# Test Standards (lazy-loaded)

Full standards: `.hive/standards/backend.mdc` (section 8) and `.hive/standards/frontend.mdc`

## Quick reference

- **AAA pattern**: Arrange → Act → Assert. One behavior per test.
- **Red first**: tests must fail before implementation exists.
- Test names: plain English specs — `"should return 400 when email is missing"`
- No `test.only`, `test.skip`, `xit`, `fit` in committed code
- Mock all external dependencies (Prisma, HTTP clients, logger)
- `jest.clearAllMocks()` in `beforeEach`
- Coverage threshold: 90% (branches, functions, lines, statements)
